RegesARC
Copyright (C) 2026 Davidio Dev / iBoss21

RegesARC is one launcher for Mixture-of-Experts models that do not fit in a
consumer GPU. It is not a fork-of-a-fork and it does not vendor upstream git
history. Mechanisms below were absorbed from pinned upstreams. Copyright
notices stay.

Strata
  Copyright (C) Niko1221 and contributors
  https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata
  License: MIT
  Absorbed: consumer-GPU placement (dense trunk and hot experts on the card,
  cold experts streamed) and the OpenAI / Anthropic localhost server shape.
  Not absorbed: START-HERE.bat, their model pack, their repo layout.

Colibri
  Copyright (C) Vincenzo Fornaro (JustVugg) and contributors
  https://github.com/JustVugg/colibri
  License: Apache-2.0
  Absorbed: one-engine-file-per-MoE-family, safetensors range reads, expert
  cache, disk streaming when the card cannot hold the hot set.
  Not absorbed: the coli launcher, their web dashboard, their repo layout.

Apache-2.0 patent grant and MIT notice requirements survive this rebrand.
If an engine file lands in engines/, the commit that added it records the
upstream tag it was taken from. If this file disagrees with the code, the
code is right and this file is a bug.
